10 REM HELLO FROM THE APPLE II
20 REM LO-RES COLOUR FIRST, THEN THE GREETING DOWN THE TEXT SCREEN
30 GR
40 FOR P=0 TO 3
50 FOR R=0 TO 39
60 COLOR=(R+P*5) MOD 16
70 HLIN 0,39 AT R
80 NEXT R
90 NEXT P
100 REM TEXT LEAVES THE COLOUR BEHIND AS CHARACTERS; -936 IS THE MONITOR'S HOME
110 TEXT
120 CALL -936
130 FOR I=1 TO 20
140 VTAB I
150 TAB I MOD 17+1
160 PRINT "HELLO FROM THE APPLE II"
170 NEXT I
180 VTAB 23
190 TAB 14
200 PRINT "* BASICALLY *"
210 END
